@startuml
!theme plain

title Post Endpoint Sequence - POST /api/v1/posts

autonumber

actor Member
participant PostController
participant CreatePostUseCase
participant CreatePostService
database UserRepository
database PostRepository
participant PostTopicCatalog
database RedisCache

Member -> PostController: POST /api/v1/posts\nPostCreationRequest
PostController -> CreatePostUseCase: createPost(request, currentUser)
CreatePostUseCase -> CreatePostService: createPost()

CreatePostService -> UserRepository: findById(userId)
UserRepository --> CreatePostService: User

alt parentPostId != null (Shared Post)
  CreatePostService -> PostRepository: findById(parentPostId)
  PostRepository --> CreatePostService: Parent Post
  
  alt parentPost is shared post
    CreatePostService --> PostController: throw POST_ALREADY_SHARED
    PostController --> Member: 400 Bad Request
  else parentPost is private & not owned by user
    CreatePostService --> PostController: throw POST_NOT_ACCESSIBLE
    PostController --> Member: 403 Forbidden
  else accessible & not already shared
    CreatePostService -> PostRepository: existsByUserIdAndParentPostIdAndType(userId, parentPostId, SHARE)
    PostRepository --> CreatePostService: false
    
    CreatePostService -> CreatePostService: Register transaction synchronization afterCommit
    note over CreatePostService: After transaction commits:\nIncrement shareCount delta key in Redis\nAdd key to "share:delta:keys" set
  end
end

CreatePostService -> PostTopicCatalog: normalizeAndValidate(topicSlugs)
PostTopicCatalog --> CreatePostService: validatedTopicSlugs

CreatePostService -> PostRepository: save(Post)
PostRepository --> CreatePostService: savedPost

CreatePostService -> RedisCache: delete("user:feed:" + userId)
note right: Invalidates the cache so\nnew post appears immediately
RedisCache --> CreatePostService: success

CreatePostService --> CreatePostUseCase: savedPost
CreatePostUseCase --> PostController: PostCreationResponse
PostController --> Member: 201 Created\nApiResponse<PostCreationResponse>

@enduml
